@host = https://localhost:7186

### 1. Registro (público)
POST {{host}}/api/Auth/registro
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Ana",
  "apellido": "Pérez",
  "edad": 21,
  "correo": "ana@upc.edu.co",
  "password": "ClaveSegura2026*"
}

### 2. Login (público)
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/Auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "correo": "ana@upc.edu.co",
  "password": "ClaveSegura2026*"
}

###
@token = {{login.response.body.$.token}}

### 3. Sin token -> 401
GET {{host}}/api/Personas

### 4. Con token -> 200
GET {{host}}/api/Personas
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. ¿Qué trae mi token?
GET {{host}}/api/Auth/yo
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
